od and food spoilage. Prepare to spend the first twelve hours of the game just making food over and over again, manually, just to make sure your pals don't starve. Its a ridiculous system that feels unneeded.", "timestamp_created": 1774987754, "timestamp_updated": 1774987754, "voted_up": false, "votes_up": 1, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.454545438289642334", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "hardware": {"system_ram": "32485", "os": "Windows 11", "cpu_name": "13th Gen Intel(R) Core(TM) i9-13900K", "adapter_description": "NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4090", "vram_size": 24138}, "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "222202869", "author": {"steamid": "76561199572311548", "personaname": "ZITRIX", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561199572311548/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 10, "playtime_forever": 1318, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 0, "playtime_at_review": 341, "last_played": 1775222711, "avatar": "5e402a5648c54c646649b3f38fb82a0eac6b8820"}, "language": "english", "review": "I like turtles\r\n", "timestamp_created": 1774986961, "timestamp_updated": 1774986961, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": false, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1705651175", "reactions": []}]}